     mat_peptide     5141..7189
                     /locus_tag="PestiV2gp1"
                     /product="NTPase/RNA helicase"
                     /note="characteristic of cytopathogenic strains. This
                     protein is produced from NS2-3 as a result of various
                     recombination events involving cellular sequences (e.g.
                     ubiquitin) or a few point mutations in the BVDV strain
                     Oregon. The cleavage of BVDV NCP7 (non-pathogenic strain)
                     NS2-3 was promoted by the interaction of NS2 (suspected to
                     be a non-canonical proteinase) with cellular J-domain
                     protein Jiv (whose sequence fragment was identified in
                     pathogenic BVDV NADL); nonstructural protein NS3; serine
                     proteinase"
                     /protein_id="NP_777502.1"
